{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d4dfa0e9-91d4-8d2b-999e-bbf2a2502a5d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-14T14:52:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anthony Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, um, I got a late fee on my water and sewer bill and I mailed the check on time. Like, well before the due date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:47:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look into that. Can I get your name and the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:47:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anthony Grasso. Forty-three Farewell Street, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:47:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Grasso. Let me pull that up. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:47:58-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I have the account for 43 Farewell. I'm seeing a late charge on the most recent bill, and the last payment posted on the second of January. Do you remember when you mailed the check?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:48:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was, um, the week before Christmas. Maybe the nineteenth? I put it right in the box, so..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:48:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. And do you recall the check number or the amount?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:48:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The amount was, uh, two hundred and something. Hang on. Actually, wait. That might've been the other house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:48:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The other house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:48:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I have two properties. I've got Farewell Street and a rental over on the other side of town. I always mix up the bills, they look the same. The check I'm thinking of might've been for the rental."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:48:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. That would explain it. Do you have the rental's address handy? I can look at both accounts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:49:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's, um, let me find it. I've got the envelope somewhere. [pause] Okay, it's twelve Dyer Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, let me look at 12 Dyer. [pause] So that account shows a payment received on the twenty-ninth of December, and no late fee on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:49:20-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. So that one's fine. Then the Farewell one, I don't know, I guess I may not have sent that one yet. I thought I did. This is, I mean, it's annoying, I'm paying attention and it still..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:49:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. On the Farewell account, the previous balance was never paid in December, which is why the late charge was applied. So the check you remember likely went to Dyer Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Okay. So I owe the Farewell one. And the late fee stays?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:49:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise it's removed, but I can note that you're disputing it and that the payment mix-up involved two accounts. A supervisor would review that. If you pay the balance, it will stop accruing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:50:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, okay, note it. Whatever helps. Um, so how do I pay it? I work days, I'm not out until like five. Can I come in after four-thirty? Or in the evening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:50:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The counter at City Hall closes at the end of the regular business day, so in person after four-thirty isn't possible. But you can pay online at any hour, and there's a drop box outside City Hall for checks that's available after we close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:50:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A drop box. Okay. Is that, like, safe? Does it get stamped the same day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:50:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Payments placed in the box after hours are collected and processed the next business day. If you're worried about the date, paying online will show the date you pay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, online's probably easier. I'll do that tonight. My kid's teacher sends a weekly email with all these little emoji in it, and I'm always on the computer for that anyway, so I'll just do it then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:51:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. You'll want your account number from the bill. Be sure you choose the Farewell Street account, not Dyer Street, since they're separate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:51:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, yeah, I'll check twice. It's on the top right, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:51:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's near the top of the bill, yes, labeled account number. The service address is printed right under your name, so you can confirm it matches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:51:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. And you'll put the note about the fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:51:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm adding it now. Can I confirm a callback number in case the supervisor has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:51:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:52:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-three. Got it. Someone should reach out within a few business days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks. I'll pay it tonight then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:52:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Grasso. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T14:52:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
